{"title":"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 18","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(more_efficient)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (more efficient)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_by_MathTalks\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video by MathTalks</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A decorative window is made up of a rectangle with semicircles at either end. The ratio of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/5/bc56862b1fdb71204894da278e42ef75de73a40b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/e/80e47d95347d6e72d1b3e8a4aea3dd20082f3cc3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3:2$\" width=\"32\" height=\"12\" />. And <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> is 30 inches. What is the ratio of the area of the rectangle to the combined area of the semicircles?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/d/1bd7bb101d1f617dcc2d568edfde1a17ef3345b4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] import graph; size(5cm); real lsf=0; pen dps=linewidth(0.7)+fontsize(8); defaultpen(dps); pen ds=black; real xmin=-4.27,xmax=14.73,ymin=-3.22,ymax=6.8; draw((0,4)--(0,0)); draw((0,0)--(2.5,0)); draw((2.5,0)--(2.5,4)); draw((2.5,4)--(0,4)); draw(shift((1.25,4))*xscale(1.25)*yscale(1.25)*arc((0,0),1,0,180)); draw(shift((1.25,0))*xscale(1.25)*yscale(1.25)*arc((0,0),1,-180,0)); dot((0,0),ds); label(&quot;$A$&quot;,(-0.26,-0.23),NE*lsf); dot((2.5,0),ds); label(&quot;$B$&quot;,(2.61,-0.26),NE*lsf); dot((0,4),ds); label(&quot;$D$&quot;,(-0.26,4.02),NE*lsf); dot((2.5,4),ds); label(&quot;$C$&quot;,(2.64,3.98),NE*lsf); clip((xmin,ymin)--(xmin,ymax)--(xmax,ymax)--(xmax,ymin)--cycle);[/asy]\" width=\"122\" height=\"238\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/3/213406dc81dec3a25a386674787cbe3237ed6f68.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 2:3\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 3:2\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 6:\\pi\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 9:\\pi\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 30 :\\pi$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"485\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can set a proportion:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/c/9dc8ec1f9de87f93331eca33e68b9a9bfb4fe1be.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\dfrac{AD}{AB}=\\dfrac{3}{2}\\]\" width=\"67\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>We substitute <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> with 30 and solve for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/5/bc56862b1fdb71204894da278e42ef75de73a40b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/c/bdc8fcd7c68f8cda8f0d49383feb93a5f8415894.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\dfrac{AD}{30}=\\dfrac{3}{2}\\]\" width=\"67\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/e/f1e60700abae8840538f90cd4b41361fd259e31e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[AD=45\\]\" width=\"70\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>We calculate the combined area of semicircle by putting together semicircle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/4/0948661e822f2a953c43a57ac9e40b2734476de4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> to get a circle with radius <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. Thus, the area is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/2/2d278824e5c4085035bed8e1deaccd9825a21dd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$225\\pi$\" width=\"37\" height=\"12\" />. The area of the rectangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/d/05d35acd3debd838c8fbc3da567ac96467a11918.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30\\cdot 45=1350$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"109\" height=\"13\" />. We calculate the ratio:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/4/e2419c749922191e5f080078e22383b0ce4f17ae.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\dfrac{1350}{225\\pi}=\\dfrac{6}{\\pi}\\Rightarrow\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 6:\\pi}\\]\" width=\"189\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28more_efficient.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(more_efficient)\">Solution 2 (more efficient)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (more efficient)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can solve this without the measurement of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/1/651ba418a810d971dbc8a326d49a71fe1541fae0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> inches. Let the constant of proportionality between the sides of the rectangle be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />. \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/e/aee62736ccc262b798d5eb1237a4b9fbc66450e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{A_{rect}}{A_{circle}}=\\frac{3k*2k}{\\pi(\\frac{2k}{2})^2}=\\frac{6k^2}{\\pi k^2}=\\frac{6}{\\pi}\\Rightarrow\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 6:\\pi}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"343\" height=\"48\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/j3QSD5eDpzU?t=657\">https://youtu.be/j3QSD5eDpzU?t=657</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_by_MathTalks\">Video by MathTalks</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video by MathTalks\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KSYVsSJDX-0&amp;feature=youtu.be\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KSYVsSJDX-0&amp;feature=youtu.be</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by WhyMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/zoWJrxTCYPM\">https://youtu.be/zoWJrxTCYPM</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8\" title=\"2010 AMC 8\">2010 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2010\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 17\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Prob